						200631406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杰克"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631406,
					"content": "咳，咳！我突然想起了一个新的故事，杰克，你要听吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斯坦利"
				},
				{
